        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\((2, 4)\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "a",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(r^2=x^2+y^2,\\ r\\cos\\theta=x,\\ r\\sin\\theta=y\\) বসিয়ে পাই \\(x^2+y^2+2x+4y-3=0\\)।\nকেন্দ্র \\((-g,-f)=(-1,-2)\\)",
      "source": {
